    "description": "Share of households with no vehicle available, pale yellow through teal to navy. Measured over all 32,819 ZIP Code Tabulation Areas with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 0.75%/3%/5%/8%/13%, which fall at the 19th/41st/60th/79th/91st percentile of the national distribution. 53.24% of ZIP Code Tabulation Areas have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 at this geography, too many to fade without washing the map out, so read pct_hh_no_vehicle_moe in the GeoParquet before drawing a conclusion from any single ZCTA.",
